<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1956</h1><p class="ref-lede">1956 in world history: 17 events, 7 births, 13 deaths, 4 works, 2 states founded and 14 that came to an end. 345 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
